      <div type="clause" n="32">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 32</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æfre alecgan heonan forð þa unlaga þe ure hlaford oft ⁊ gelome silf het alecgan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And there shall henceforth be an end to the unjust practices which our lord himself has frequently and often commanded us to stop.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æfre alicgan heonan forð þa unlaga, þe ær þysan wæran to gewunelice wide.</ab>
      </div>
